  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Compound verb: {吹|ふ}く + {出|だ}す.\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action for sense 1 ({水|みず}が{吹|ふ}き{出|だ}している = water is gushing).\n\nNUANCE: The {出|だ}す component emphasizes the sudden start of the action. In sense 2, it suggests an involuntary outburst.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{思|おも}わず→思わず：02549_omowazu⟧{吹|ふ}き{出|だ}す: to burst out laughing unintentionally\n- ⟦{噴水|ふんすい}→噴水：09637_funsui⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}き{出|だ}す: a fountain spouts water",
